# Optional: only needed if you switch "Where the model runs" to Purdue GenAI Studio.
# Running locally with Ollama needs no .env.local file or API key at all.
#
# To enable Purdue GenAI Studio:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local (which is git-ignored).
# 2. Paste your API key from GenAI Studio › Settings › Account › API Keys.
# 3. Restart `npm run dev` (or `npm run preview`).
GENAI_API_KEY=
